    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Baazi</strong> is a razor-sharp solitaire-style dungeon crawler played with an ordinary deck of cards\u2014reshuffled into something deadly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey begins with 20 Health and a shuffled dungeon of cards. Each turn, you flip 4 cards to form a Room\u2014packed with Monsters (Spades &amp; Clubs), Weapons (Diamonds), and Potions (Hearts). You must confront 3 of them. The 4th one lingers\u2026 becoming part of your next Room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision is survival. Do you equip a flimsy weapon and risk facing a King? Do you gulp that one Potion and waste the other? Or skip the Room entirely\u2014knowing you can't do that twice in a row?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat is brutal and binding.</strong> Once a weapon slays a monster, it\u2019s locked into that level. You can only kill weaker foes from then on. Misjudge once, and you might find yourself barehanded against a 13-point brute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Rule Lineage</strong> \u2013 Inspired by the 2011 cult micro-classic <i>Scoundrel</i>; expanded, balanced, and visually overhauled for modern PCs</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udca0 <strong>Card-based Dungeon Delving</strong> \u2013 No board, no dice\u2014just a standard deck of cards turned into something tense and tactical.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f <strong>Tactical Weapon Degradation</strong> \u2013 Weapons degrade in usefulness as you slay tougher monsters. Plan ahead or fall hard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2665\ufe0f <strong>Potions with a Limit</strong> \u2013 Heal once per turn, and only up to 20. No hoarding, no second chances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Room Avoidance Mechanic</strong> \u2013 Skip a Room, but never two. The deck gets thinner\u2014and deadlier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2620\ufe0f <strong>Score by Survival</strong> \u2013 End with positive health to win. Or tally how deep you made it before the Dungeon claimed you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u267e\ufe0f <strong>Endless Mode</strong> \u2013 Conquer the core dungeon, then dive into an infinite descent where rooms recycle and escalate. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Leaderboard</strong> \u2013 Track and share your deepest delve.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rules Modifiers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee0 Blacksmith :\u00a0</strong>Shuffles the <strong>Jack of \u2666</strong> back into the Dungeon. When played, it <i>repairs</i> your weapon by clearing every monster stacked on it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udddb Vampire</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lifts the one-potion-per-room restriction</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfad Baazigar</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inserts a single <strong>Joker (value 21)</strong>\u2014the ultimate boss card\u2014to the Dungeon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780890/extras/110c9ab5a0ea839547bbe7e66beffbb7.avif?t=1752674085\" width=209 height=245 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to learn. Ruthless to master.</strong><br><strong>Baazi</strong> turns every card flip into a gamble\u2014and every choice into a test of cunning.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Baazi</strong> is a razor-sharp solitaire-style dungeon crawler played with an ordinary deck of cards\u2014reshuffled into something deadly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey begins with 20 Health and a shuffled dungeon of cards. Each turn, you flip 4 cards to form a Room\u2014packed with Monsters (Spades &amp; Clubs), Weapons (Diamonds), and Potions (Hearts). You must confront 3 of them. The 4th one lingers\u2026 becoming part of your next Room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision is survival. Do you equip a flimsy weapon and risk facing a King? Do you gulp that one Potion and waste the other? Or skip the Room entirely\u2014knowing you can't do that twice in a row?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat is brutal and binding.</strong> Once a weapon slays a monster, it\u2019s locked into that level. You can only kill weaker foes from then on. Misjudge once, and you might find yourself barehanded against a 13-point brute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Rule Lineage</strong> \u2013 Inspired by the 2011 cult micro-classic <i>Scoundrel</i>; expanded, balanced, and visually overhauled for modern PCs</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udca0 <strong>Card-based Dungeon Delving</strong> \u2013 No board, no dice\u2014just a standard deck of cards turned into something tense and tactical.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f <strong>Tactical Weapon Degradation</strong> \u2013 Weapons degrade in usefulness as you slay tougher monsters. Plan ahead or fall hard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2665\ufe0f <strong>Potions with a Limit</strong> \u2013 Heal once per turn, and only up to 20. No hoarding, no second chances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Room Avoidance Mechanic</strong> \u2013 Skip a Room, but never two. The deck gets thinner\u2014and deadlier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2620\ufe0f <strong>Score by Survival</strong> \u2013 End with positive health to win. Or tally how deep you made it before the Dungeon claimed you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u267e\ufe0f <strong>Endless Mode</strong> \u2013 Conquer the core dungeon, then dive into an infinite descent where rooms recycle and escalate. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Leaderboard</strong> \u2013 Track and share your deepest delve.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rules Modifiers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee0 Blacksmith :\u00a0</strong>Shuffles the <strong>Jack of \u2666</strong> back into the Dungeon. When played, it <i>repairs</i> your weapon by clearing every monster stacked on it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udddb Vampire</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lifts the one-potion-per-room restriction</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfad Baazigar</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inserts a single <strong>Joker (value 21)</strong>\u2014the ultimate boss card\u2014to the Dungeon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780890/extras/110c9ab5a0ea839547bbe7e66beffbb7.avif?t=1752674085\" width=209 height=245 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to learn. Ruthless to master.</strong><br><strong>Baazi</strong> turns every card flip into a gamble\u2014and every choice into a test of cunning.</p>",
